NMR标准化定量流程及其质控标准。\n    *   `external_ask`: 检索近5年（2020-2025）关于“human serum/tumor microenvironment inosine SCFA absolute quantification standardized method protocol”或“consensus guidelines metabolomics ICI response”的文献，寻找明确报道检测方法学验证（如线性范围、LOD/LOQ、批内/批间变异、基质效应校正）及在ICI治疗患者队列中应用的具体研究。\n    *   `reason`: 现有材料均为机制综述或脑肿瘤影像学研究，明确指出当前缺乏人TME或配对血清样本中目标代谢物的绝对浓度数据与标准化测量共识；脑肿瘤MRS的量化困难仅作为技术挑战的类比，未覆盖目标代谢物与样本类型。需补充专门的代谢组学方法学或临床转化检测指南以回答“是否已建立”。\n\n6.  **Refine & Check against Constraints:**\n    *   *Constraint Check:* \"先理解 user_scope 与问题对象... 特定模型、材料或场景的结果不得无依据外推... 观察关联不改写为因果关系... 输出 usable_content 为一段可直接阅读的字符串... 先呈现能区别不同研究的发现或论证... 别把多个不同对象...合成一个普适机制... 涉及数字时，先逐项输出 quantitative_comparisons... groups是[{group:原文组名,value:紧邻该组的结果含单位}]... reported_statistics记录原文给出的统计量... usable_content解释含义，不重复重排数字... decision判断当前具体问题是否解决... external_research也可以有丰富usable_content...\"\n    *   *Quantitative Comparisons:* Empty `[]` is correct because no matching quantitative data exists. I will explicitly state this in the JSON structure.\n    *   *Usable Content:* Must be a single string. I'll draft it carefully to match constraints. It should start with the direct finding regarding the question, differentiate the existing evidence (fecal relative vs. mouse model vs. brain MRS technical analogy), and end with the conclusion on the unmet status.\n    *   *Decision:* `external_research` is appropriate.\n    *   *Structure:* JSON with keys in order: quantitative_comparisons, usable_content, decision, still_missing, read_focus, external_ask, reason.\n    *   *Self-Correction/Verification during drafting:*\n        *   Check if any numbers in materials match the question's targets? No. The materials mention cohort sizes (n=52, n=11) and error percentages for brain metabolites (~15%, ~35%), but these don't relate to inosine/SCFA absolute concentrations in serum/TME. So `quantitative_comparisons` remains `[]`.\n        *   Ensure `usable_content` doesn't synthesize different objects into one mechanism. It co